{"cited_chunk_ids_snapshot":["bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p160:0152","bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p167:0159","bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p168:0160"],"cited_chunk_set_delta":{"added":["bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p160:0152","bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p167:0159","bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p168:0160"],"removed":[]},"event_checksum":"92cb3a6b840c52430562842c249e8459f24b93f6cd140935de03f4721dc5555b","frontmatter_field_changes":["citations","id","reading_id","schema_version","summary","tags","title"],"frontmatter_snapshot":{"card_edges":[],"citations":[{"chunk_hash":"6c37ce0669b4860d1ccd22b18d5a793a9e5afb22f2f62a15f36c254f1457c69e","chunk_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p160:0152","edge_type":"defines","page_range":[161,161],"quote":"probability judgments are formed using the representativeness-distorted density","source_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs"},{"chunk_hash":"456c8df2fe40a88d0ab390aa29c913fd0d3990c828acd65b868dd6c05effd6ad","chunk_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p167:0159","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[168,168],"quote":"Cash flow realizations that have become more likely in light of news are overweighted, while cash flow realizations that have become less likely are underweighted.","source_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs"},{"chunk_hash":"ccf46e712b76b82973faf98404bdbcbcfb87282394232c259722da10c95ed414","chunk_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs:p168:0160","edge_type":"supports","page_range":[169,169],"quote":"When θ = 0, diagnostic beliefs coincide with rational expectations","source_id":"bf_gennaioli_shleifer_2018_crisis_beliefs"}],"id":"be-diagnostic-expectations","reading_id":"10_behavioral_finance","schema_version":"cacg.v0","summary":"The diagnostic-expectations operator: a representativeness-distorted density h^theta(x) proportional to h(x|news) times [h(x|news)/h(x|baseline)]^theta, renormalized; the diagnostic expectation E^theta over-weights states made representative by recent news, theta tunes the distortion, and theta=0 recovers rational expectations.","tags":["behavioral-finance","diagnostic-expectations","representativeness","overreaction"],"title":"Diagnostic Expectations Operator"},"is_retracted":false,"new_card_hash":"8e14650473a8f8171a23c0f43c119d6478822f364c7da0b55acf36811c2fdb6f","prev_card_hash":null,"prev_checksum":null,"schema_version":"cacg.v0","seq":0,"timestamp":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z"}
